cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Lugensa AI: an agentic location web-intelligence system"
abstract: >-
  An agentic research system that investigates the public information about a place to answer a natural-language question about
  it, and produces an evidence-backed, cited assessment. Every claim is checked against its sources by a deterministic verifier,
  and what could not be confirmed is listed. It runs on a local model, with no billed model API.
type: software
